; A3 - the device multiplier, at netlist level.
;
; Four things that must agree, pairwise: a resistor with m=4 against four in parallel written out;
; a capacitor with m=4 against 4x the capacitance; and a diode with m=4 against one of four times
; the area. Nothing here is a stored number - each pair is its own oracle.
Port:P1  a 0  Num=1 Z=50
Port:P2  b 0  Num=2 Z=50

R:Rm     a 0  R=400 m=4
R:Rref   b 0  R=100
